# game/week4.rpy:8
translate indonesian week4_start_f6f13bc4:

    # n "The morning breeze, infused with a subtle hint of air conditioning, greeted you as you entered the classroom."
    n  "Semilir angin pagi yang berpadu dengan sejuknya pendingin ruangan menyambutmu saat melangkah masuk ke dalam kelas."

# game/week4.rpy:9
translate indonesian week4_start_a6559d84:

    # n "You looked over the seats from the front to the back, looking for the person who had become closest to you in the last few days."
    n  "Matamu mengamati deretan bangku dari depan hingga belakang, mencari sosok yang biasanya selalu menyapamu ceria."

# game/week4.rpy:10
translate indonesian week4_start_5ee4dea9:

    # n "Your gaze landed on Trida's vacant desk."
    n  "Pandanganmu akhirnya terpaku pada bangku Trida yang masih kosong melompong."

# game/week4.rpy:11
translate indonesian week4_start_5af7c660:

    # n "A short pause occurred as you recognized they were probably going to be late, and a slight smile appeared on your face."
    n  "Jeda hening terjadi saat kamu menyadari kemungkinan ia bakal telat lagi hari ini, dan kamu hanya bisa tertawa kecil."

# game/week4.rpy:14
translate indonesian week4_start_f6b8744b:

    # radit "Did they install a new statue in class or something?"
    radit  "Ada patung baru ya dipasang di kelas?"

# game/week4.rpy:15
translate indonesian week4_start_85268159:

    # n "You jolted, turning to find Radit's signature cheeky grin. Right, him."
    n  "Kamu terlonjak kaget, menoleh dan mendapati seringai usil khas Radit. Ah, bener kan, dia."

# game/week4.rpy:16
translate indonesian week4_start_a3741e1f:

    # p "Morning, Radit."
    p  "Pagi, Radit."

# game/week4.rpy:17
translate indonesian week4_start_787d312a:

    # n "Radit eyed you for a second, then snorted, thumping your backpack so hard it drew a few stares from your classmates."
    n  "Radit menatapmu sesaat, lalu mendengus geli seraya menepuk ranselmu cukup keras hingga menarik perhatian beberapa teman di sekitar."

# game/week4.rpy:18
translate indonesian week4_start_c536a04e:

    # radit "Stop grinning at nothing. People are going to think you've gone off the rails already."
    radit  "Nggak usah senyum-senyum sendiri napa. Nanti orang-orang ngira kamu udah mulai korslet saking banyaknya tugas."

# game/week4.rpy:19
translate indonesian week4_start_5bd4206e:

    # p "Oh! Yeah, uh... Have you seen Trida?"
    p  "Oh! Iya, um... kamu lihat Trida nggak?"

# game/week4.rpy:21
translate indonesian week4_start_3107c1bf:

    # n "You headed to your usual desks, the strap of the heavy backpack digging into your shoulder."
    n  "Kamu melangkah menuju bangku biasamu, tali ransel yang berat terasa menekan pundakmu saat bergesekan dengan kemeja seragam."

# game/week4.rpy:22
translate indonesian week4_start_0fc9ace0:

    # n "Radit casually threw his bag onto his chair and started pulling out his books, dropping them onto his desk with practiced ease."
    n  "Radit melemparkan tasnya santai ke atas kursi dan mulai mengeluarkan buku-bukunya, tampak tak peduli dengan kegelisahanmu."

# game/week4.rpy:23
translate indonesian week4_start_d8c185b6:

    # radit "Probably late. You know how they are. By the way, did you finish that math assignment?"
    radit  "Palingan telat. Kamu kan tahu sendiri dia kayak gimana. Btw, tugas matematika yang kemarin kamu udah kelar belum?"

# game/week4.rpy:28
translate indonesian week4_start_1d301d77:

    # trida "RADIT!"
    trida  "RADIT!"

# game/week4.rpy:30
translate indonesian week4_start_f28e7bf6:

    # n "A rhythmic jingle of keys announced their presence before the door even clicked open."
    n  "Gemrincing gantungan kunci yang berirama mengumumkan kehadirannya bahkan sebelum gagang pintu sempat ditekan."

# game/week4.rpy:31
translate indonesian week4_start_fd83135e:

    # n "Trida skidded into the room, their chest heaving and their hair disheveled from the dash."
    n  "Trida meluncur masuk ke dalam kelas, dadanya naik-turun terengah-engah dan rambutnya berantakan akibat berlari terburu-buru."

# game/week4.rpy:32
translate indonesian week4_start_9e0eaf15:

    # n "They didn't have the breath for a full speech—just enough for a pointed glare."
    n  "Napasnya bahkan belum cukup buat pidato panjang—cuma cukup buat melayangkan tatapan tajam nan menusuk ke arah Radit."

# game/week4.rpy:33
translate indonesian week4_start_bb9e9474:

    # trida "You... *huff*... You left me behind!"
    trida  "Kamu... *hah*... Kamu tega banget ninggalin aku!"

# game/week4.rpy:35
translate indonesian week4_start_65db2001:

    # n "They grabbed Radit by the shoulders, shaking him frantically."
    n  "Ia mencengkeram kedua bahu Radit, mengguncang-guncangnya dengan panik."

# game/week4.rpy:36
translate indonesian week4_start_a91a7a93:

    # n "Radit didn't even flinch, his expression settling into the exhausted 'done-with-this' look he reserved for Trida's morning meltdowns."
    n  "Radit bahkan tidak bergeming sedikit pun, raut wajahnya berubah datar khas orang yang sudah kenyang menghadapi tingkah absurd Trida."

# game/week4.rpy:37
translate indonesian week4_start_e589055b:

    # radit "Because the last time I knocked on your door, I heard nothing but your alarm wailing for the tenth time. Which means..."
    radit  "Soalnya pas terakhir kali aku gedor pintumu, yang kedengeran cuma suara alarm yang kamu biarin bunyi selama empat puluh menit penuh."

# game/week4.rpy:38
translate indonesian week4_start_8dbd814b:

    # trida "...I overslept."
    trida  "...Aku kesiangan."

# game/week4.rpy:40
translate indonesian week4_start_c194b4ca:

    # n "Watching their casual, lifted banter, something finally clicked in your mind."
    n  "Melihat perdebatan santai dan akrab di antara mereka berdua, sesuatu mendadak menyala di benakmu."

# game/week4.rpy:41
translate indonesian week4_start_edbff224:

    # p "Wait, do you two live in the same boarding house?"
    p  "Tunggu, kalian berdua tinggal di satu kos yang sama ya?"

# game/week4.rpy:42
translate indonesian week4_start_40dfa2de:

    # n "Both of them now turn their faces to you, but the very differences in their contrasting expressions make you kind of want to laugh."
    n  "Keduanya serempak menolehkan wajah ke arahmu, namun dengan ekspresi yang sangat bertolak belakang."

# game/week4.rpy:43
translate indonesian week4_start_846519b1:

    # radit "Sadly, yes..."
    radit  "Sayangnya, iya..."

# game/week4.rpy:44
translate indonesian week4_start_539bca35:

    # n "Radit let out a heavy sigh as his shoulders tensed up."
    n  "Radit menghela napas berat seraya menegakkan pundaknya yang kaku."

# game/week4.rpy:45
translate indonesian week4_start_4d216c18:

    # trida "Sounds fun, right?"
    trida  "Kedengarannya seru banget kan?"

# game/week4.rpy:46
translate indonesian week4_start_3f57d3e3:

    # radit "Nah, it's a living nightmare. Imagine living across a rhythm game player who thinks the whole building needs to hear the combo sound effects at 2 AM."
    radit  "Kagak, itu mimpi buruk di dunia nyata. Bayangin aja tinggal berhadapan sama player rhythm game yang mikir jam dua pagi itu waktu yang pas buat mencet tombol sekuat tenaga."

# game/week4.rpy:47
translate indonesian week4_start_d5cd5549:

    # trida "It's called grinding, Radit! I was trying to S-rank a track, okay?"
    trida  "Itu namanya grinding, Radit! Aku kan lagi berusaha dapet S-rank di lagu itu, paham nggak sih?!"

# game/week4.rpy:49
translate indonesian week4_start_e230c99f:

    # n "You dropped the bag onto your chair with a heavy thud, feeling the familiar weight of exhaustion."
    n  "Kamu meletakkan tasmu ke kursi dengan bunyi debuk mantap, merasakan beban familiar itu lepas dari pundakmu."

# game/week4.rpy:50
translate indonesian week4_start_dd055ff8:

    # n "Your hand rubbed your eyes, letting out a long, slow breath as you leaned against the desk."
    n  "Tanganmu mengusap pelan kedua matamu, menghembuskan napas panjang seraya bersandar di kursi."

# game/week4.rpy:51
translate indonesian week4_start_e8599a2d:

    # p "Of course, they were at it again..."
    p  "Udah pasti mereka berdua mulai ribut lagi..."

# game/week4.rpy:53
translate indonesian week4_start_0949b937:

    # trida "And for your information, the lore in this new JRPG is literally life-changing. I couldn't just turn it off mid-cutscene."
    trida  "Dan asal kamu tahu ya, lore di game JRPG baru ini bener-bener gila banget alurnya. Bikin takjub!"

# game/week4.rpy:54
translate indonesian week4_start_fc9f6e2a:

    # n "You saw Radit start to spin his chair around and lean back with his arm behind his head."
    n  "Kamu melihat Radit memutar kursinya dan menyandarkan tubuh santai dengan kedua tangan di belakang kepala."

# game/week4.rpy:55
translate indonesian week4_start_8d682ccc:

    # n "With those half-lidded eyes moving to yours and that smirk tugging around, you knew you were going to be dragged along with this."
    n  "Dengan tatapan sayu yang beralih menatapmu dan seringai tipis yang tersungging, kamu tahu ia sedang bersiap melancarkan serangan balasan."

# game/week4.rpy:56
translate indonesian week4_start_705bd31c:

    # radit "Right. 'Life-changing...' You spent three hours dying to the same boss fight and screaming at your screen. I'm pretty sure someone beside your room is convinced you're running a fight club."
    radit  "Iya deh, 'bikin takjub'... Kamu ngabisin waktu tiga jam cuma buat mati di bos yang sama berulang-ulang sampai frustrasi."

# game/week4.rpy:58
translate indonesian week4_start_d9a75255:

    # n "Trida started slamming their hands on your desk, then leaned closer and grabbed your arms, along with those wide-looking eyes that are always there when they are over-caffeinated."
    n  "Trida mulai menepuk-nepuk mejamu, lalu mencondongkan tubuh mendekat dan meraih ujung seragammu untuk mencari pembelaan."

# game/week4.rpy:59
translate indonesian week4_start_e97b9f17:

    # trida "It's about progression, man! Seeing yourself get better at the mechanics—it's the best feeling!"
    trida  "Ini tuh soal progres permainan, Bos! Melihat kemampuan kita berkembang dari mekanik game—itu poin intinya!"

# game/week4.rpy:60
translate indonesian week4_start_1d0f81f1:

    # trida "[player_name], tell him! Isn't it better to actually have a hobby you're passionate about instead of just... I don't know, staring at a wall and judging people?"
    trida  "[player_name], kasih tahu dia dong! Bukannya lebih asyik kalau punya hobi yang bener-bener kita sukai daripada cuma kerjaannya ngehakimi orang doang?"

# game/week4.rpy:62
translate indonesian week4_start_cb076b05:

    # n "You shifted in your seat, the wooden edge digging into your hips. You look over at Radit, who is lazily spinning a pen between his fingers. He doesn't even look bothered by the jab."
    n  "Kamu bergeser di kursimu, tepi kayu meja terasa menekan pinggangmu. Kamu menatap Radit yang duduk santai."

# game/week4.rpy:63
translate indonesian week4_start_5bb26ead:

    # radit "Judging people? Nah. I'm just observing."
    radit  "Ngehakimi orang? Kagak lah. Aku kan cuma mengamati secara objektif."

# game/week4.rpy:64
translate indonesian week4_start_3b95940e:

    # radit "Like how I observed you losing that same boss fight for four hours straight last night because you kept trying to brute-force the parry window."
    radit  "Persis kayak pas aku mengamati kamu kalah di bos yang sama selama empat jam berturut-turut semalam."

# game/week4.rpy:66
translate indonesian week4_start_2ca192fd:

    # n "Trida froze mid-gesture, their ears flushing a bright, indignant red."
    n  "Gerakan Trida seketika membeku, daun telinganya merona merah padam menahan malu bercampur jengkel."

# game/week4.rpy:67
translate indonesian week4_start_414aaffe:

    # n "You blinked, genuinely surprised by Radit's confession."
    n  "Kamu mengerjap, sejujurnya agak kaget mendengar pengakuan Radit itu."

# game/week4.rpy:68
translate indonesian week4_start_9c0edc76:

    # p "So he was paying attention to Trida's game after all."
    p  "Berarti selama ini Radit diam-diam memperhatikan permainan Trida ya."

# game/week4.rpy:70
translate indonesian week4_start_be9326ab:

    # trida "Wait, what? You hear the audio cues through the wall? And how do you know it's a parry issue? You haven't touched a controller since the semester started!"
    trida  "Tunggu, apa?! Kamu bisa denger audio cue-nya nembus tembok kamar? Terus dari mana kamu tahu itu bos fight yang sama?!"

# game/week4.rpy:71
translate indonesian week4_start_a4c9c95f:

    # n "Radit shrugs as he writes through his math assignment that he clearly hasn't cleared. He leans on the chair, looking completely unbothered."
    n  "Radit mengedikkan bahu santai sambil terus menulis tugas matematikanya yang jelas-jelas belum rampung."

# game/week4.rpy:72
translate indonesian week4_start_810fbfae:

    # radit "I don't need to play it to know you're playing it wrong. Your button-mashing is very rhythmic, Trida."
    radit  "Aku nggak perlu main game itu buat tahu kalau caramu main tuh salah total. Tombol yang kamu pencet asal-asalan itu kedengeran banget polanya."

# game/week4.rpy:73
translate indonesian week4_start_ce12860b:

    # n "Then he stopped writing, putting down his pen with a half-sneer coming at Trida, trying to pull more of a reaction out of them."
    n  "Lalu ia berhenti menulis, meletakkan pulpennya seraya menyunggingkan seringai mengejek ke arah Trida."

# game/week4.rpy:74
translate indonesian week4_start_7232df8c:

    # radit "If you just chilled out and timed your hits to the bass line, you'd have cleared the level days ago."
    radit  "Kalau aja kamu bisa lebih santai dan ngepasin timing seranganmu sama ketukan bass-nya, kamu pasti udah kelar dari sejam sebelumnya."

# game/week4.rpy:76
translate indonesian week4_start_0458b43f:

    # n "Trida started looking at him like he was a ghost talking. Then they threw that look back at you, then jumped back to Radit's smug face, clearly torn between wanting to argue and wanting to know what that guy is up to."
    n  "Trida menatap Radit seolah sedang melihat hantu yang bisa berbicara. Lalu ia melemparkan tatapan memohon ke arahmu."

# game/week4.rpy:77
translate indonesian week4_start_c8979738:

    # trida "[player_name], tell him he's full of it! Tell him he's just making that up to get under my skin. He's just bluffing, right?"
    trida  "[player_name], bilang ke dia kalau dia tuh sok tahu! Bilang ke dia kalau dia cuma ngarang cerita biar kelihatan keren doang!"

# game/week4.rpy:78
translate indonesian week4_start_914d6af6:

    # radit "Go on, [player_name]. Tell them, I should show them exactly what they're doing wrong on their own console, or are you going to keep letting them suffer like this?"
    radit  "Ayo dong, [player_name]. Kasih tahu dia, kalau perlu biar kutunjukin langsung di mana letak kesalahannya semalam."

# game/week4.rpy:89
translate indonesian week4_agree_radit_a872dc7e:

    # p "He's got a point, Trida. You're overthinking the mechanics. Just listen to him for once."
    p  "Omongan Radit ada benernya kok, Trida. Kamu kayaknya terlalu overthinking sama mekanik game-nya. Coba dengerin sarannya sekali-kali."

# game/week4.rpy:91
translate indonesian week4_agree_radit_d91fa51f:

    # n "Radit's smirk turns into a genuine, smug grin. He points a finger at Trida with a triumphant look."
    n  "Seringai Radit seketika berubah menjadi cengiran puas nan jemawa. Ia menunjuk ke arah Trida dengan senyum mengejek."

# game/week4.rpy:92
translate indonesian week4_agree_radit_a7770fe5:

    # radit "See? Even [player_name] is tired of your noise pollution. Admit it, I'm right."
    radit  "Tuh kan? [player_name] aja capek dengerin polusi suaramu. Akui aja kalau tebakanku bener."

# game/week4.rpy:94
translate indonesian week4_agree_radit_d849ff62:

    # n "Trida's jaw drops as they look at you with clear betrayal, their shoulders slumping as they grumble."
    n  "Mulut Trida menganga menatapmu dengan raut merasa dikhianati, pundaknya merosot lesu."

# game/week4.rpy:95
translate indonesian week4_agree_radit_8c8a7ba7:

    # trida "Wow. Fine. Everyone's a critic."
    trida  "Wah, tega banget. Ya udah deh, semua orang emang paling jago jadi kritikus."

# game/week4.rpy:104
translate indonesian week4_defend_trida_227c8b47:

    # p "Stop being a jerk, Radit. Just because you're good at the game doesn't mean you have to be a total elitist about it."
    p  "Jangan jahat-jahat gitu napa, Radit. Mentang-mentang kamu jago main game bukan berarti kamu bisa seenaknya ngejek cara main orang lain."

# game/week4.rpy:106
translate indonesian week4_defend_trida_4fd7e073:

    # n "He stops spinning his pen as his smirk fades, replaced by an unreadable expression. He shrugs, looking unaffected."
    n  "Ia berhenti memutar pulpennya saat seringainya perlahan memudar, digantikan oleh ekspresi yang sulit terbaca."

# game/week4.rpy:107
translate indonesian week4_defend_trida_18adf83c:

    # radit "Elitist? Just being honest. But sure, keep playing wrong if it makes you feel better."
    radit  "Elitis? Aku cuma jujur kok. Tapi ya udah terserah, lanjutin aja main salah-salah gitu kalau emang bikin hatimu seneng."

# game/week4.rpy:109
translate indonesian week4_defend_trida_932010d3:

    # n "Trida practically beams, their mood shifting from frustration to relief instantly. They hit their fist against the desk, pointing it at Radit."
    n  "Wajah Trida seketika berseri-seri penuh kemenangan, suasana hatinya berubah dari jengkel menjadi lega dalam sekejap."

# game/week4.rpy:110
translate indonesian week4_defend_trida_676b3dc8:

    # trida "Exactly! Thank you! See, Radit? Even [player_name] thinks you're being a pain."
    trida  "Tepat banget! Makasih ya! Tuh denger kan, Radit? [player_name] aja ngerasa kamu tuh nyebelin banget."

# game/week4.rpy:126
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_ad54916e:

    # n "After the most chaotic morning you could imagine, the three of you finally managed to get along in class."
    n  "Setelah melewati pagi paling kacau yang bisa dibayangkan, kalian bertiga akhirnya berhasil bertahan melalui jam-jam pelajaran sekolah."

# game/week4.rpy:127
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_aa26c367:

    # n "Whether it's a dull history lecture or a math session where everything seems confusing, time eventually moves on."
    n  "Mulai dari materi sejarah yang membosankan sampai sesi matematika rumit di mana semua angka terasa memusingkan kepala."

# game/week4.rpy:128
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_1a08daf6:

    # n "When the bell rings, signaling break time, it feels like the end of a battle."
    n  "Saat bel berdentang menandakan jam istirahat tiba, rasanya bagaikan akhir dari sebuah pertempuran sengit."

# game/week4.rpy:130
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_eeccdb95:

    # n "You've just come back from the teacher's office after delivering everyone's math books when you spot a tall person in front of the studio talking with some seniors."
    n  "Kamu baru saja kembali dari ruang guru setelah mengumpulkan tumpukan buku tugas matematika milik seluruh kelas."

# game/week4.rpy:131
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_140ff001:

    # n "Out of nowhere, they all turn to face you and then walk away, leaving Radit by himself."
    n  "Tiba-tiba saja, teman-teman lain berbalik dan langsung berhamburan keluar kelas, menyisakan Radit yang duduk sendirian di mejanya."

# game/week4.rpy:133
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_52be900b:

    # radit "You finished?"
    radit  "Udah beres?"

# game/week4.rpy:134
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_c72661e1:

    # p "Yeah, I already turned in everyone's books."
    p  "Udah, semua buku tugas udah kukumpulin ke meja guru tadi."

# game/week4.rpy:135
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_8aba2165:

    # radit "Great job. You handle everything well, unlike someone, I guess..."
    radit  "Kerja bagus. Kamu emang selalu bisa diandalkan buat beres-beres, nggak kayak seseorang tuh..."

# game/week4.rpy:137
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_f1f2dca5:

    # n "Radit put both of his hands in his pockets as his face looked afar where Trida is busy talking with other students and trips on their own foot, their movements as chaotic as their morning."
    n  "Radit memasukkan kedua tangannya ke saku celana seraya memandang jauh ke arah luar jendela tempat Trida berada."

# game/week4.rpy:138
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_d88fdf21:

    # n "Radit lets out a low huff as his eyes observe Trida's movement."
    n  "Radit menghela napas pelan saat matanya memperhatikan gerak-gerik Trida di kejauhan."

# game/week4.rpy:139
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_93b2d400:

    # radit "They've been trying to min-max that party build for, like, three days straight. They're gonna waste their whole lunch break grinding for a drop that literally doesn't exist."
    radit  "Dia tuh udah sibuk ngotak-ngatik party build game-nya selama tiga hari berturut-turut. Sampe begadang nggak jelas."

# game/week4.rpy:140
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_b9bbbaf8:

    # n "He looks bored, but there's a flicker of annoyance in his eyes—not at Trida, just at how hard they're making it on themself."
    n  "Ia tampak bosan, tapi ada secercah rasa jengkel yang tertahan di matanya—bukan jengkel ke Trida, melainkan ke kebiasaan keras kepalanya."

# game/week4.rpy:141
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_4be00ae0:

    # radit "I might have ended up hopping into their save file tonight and re-specced their main DPS. Swapped their gear for a late-game crit build and fixed their whole rotation."
    radit  "Bisa-bisa ntar malam aku terpaksa login ke save data game-nya terus kubenerin status build karakternya biar dia nggak kalah mulu."

# game/week4.rpy:142
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_ac8d6050:

    # n "He lets out a dry and tired laugh, glancing at his own shoes."
    n  "Ia tertawa kering dan letih, melirik sekilas ke arah ujung sepatunya sendiri."

# game/week4.rpy:143
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_cb6a9bdf:

    # radit "Whatever. Don't tell them about that, though."
    radit  "Terserah lah. Tapi jangan bilang-bilang ke dia soal itu ya."

# game/week4.rpy:145
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_72e71e8f:

    # p "Wait, so you're actually helping them?"
    p  "Tunggu, jadi aslinya kamu beneran mau bantuin dia nih?"

# game/week4.rpy:146
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_76587270:

    # n "He looks at you, clearly with a sense of softness between those unusual eyes. Then he lets out a scoff that rings in your ears."
    n  "Ia menatapmu, sorot matanya yang biasanya datar tampak melembut sejenak. Lalu pandangannya beralih menatap lantai."

# game/week4.rpy:147
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_aaab859b:

    # radit "I just want them to stop losing. It's getting painful to watch."
    radit  "Aku cuma mau dia berhenti kalah mulu. Sakit mata ngelihatnya."

# game/week4.rpy:150
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_1a84fb3a:

    # n "Before you can even reply, a voice cuts through the air. You look up to see Sabian looking super spirited as he moves from the studio doors."
    n  "Sebelum kamu sempat menanggapi kalimatnya, sebuah suara lantang memecah udara. Kamu mendongak dan melihat Sabian bersandar santai di kusen pintu."

# game/week4.rpy:153
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_706693d1:

    # sabian "Yo, [player_name]! Finally done?"
    sabian  "Yoo, [player_name]! Akhirnya kelar juga?"

# game/week4.rpy:154
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_da59d717:

    # p "Oh-yeah, just running a couple of errands."
    p  "Oh-iya, tadi habis nganterin beberapa tugas ke ruang guru."

# game/week4.rpy:155
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_daf80793:

    # sabian "Come on, skip studying for a second. We're grabbing lunch, you should come through."
    sabian  "Ayo lah, skip belajar bentar napa. Kita mau makan siang nih, lu harus ikutan nongkrong bareng kita!"

# game/week4.rpy:156
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_1155d668:

    # n "Sabian doesn't even wait for your words. He just gives you that very pleading look."
    n  "Sabian bahkan tidak menunggu jawabanmu. Ia langsung memasang tampang memohon yang kocak dan memintamu ikut."

# game/week4.rpy:157
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_5bed55d5:

    # n "You glance back at Radit, who is already giving his questioning look."
    n  "Kamu melirik kembali ke arah Radit, yang sedang menatapmu dengan pandangan bertanya-tanya."

# game/week4.rpy:158
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_cc200980:

    # radit "Guess you've been recruited. Honestly, chilling with the seniors beats sitting listening to Trida complain all day."
    radit  "Kayaknya kamu udah direkrut tuh. Sejujurnya, nongkrong bareng senior di kantin jauh lebih mending dibanding bengong di kelas."

# game/week4.rpy:159
translate indonesian week4_break_grapos_d3eb41dc:

    # n "But you clearly know that tone means he hoped you would accompany him."
    n  "Namun dari nada bicaranya, kamu tahu terselip harapan kecil agar kamu tetap menemaninya di kelas."

# game/week4.rpy:170
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_32c51db3:

    # p "Catch you later, Radit. I'm starving, and I don't think I can handle Trida's gaming meltdowns on an empty stomach."
    p  "Sampai ketemu nanti ya, Radit. Aku laper banget nih, dan kayaknya kepalaku belum sanggup dengerin ocehan game Trida lagi."

# game/week4.rpy:171
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_7fb89a20:

    # n "Radit scoffs, his lazy eyes rolling toward the ceiling."
    n  "Radit mendengus pelan, matanya yang malas melirik ke arah langit-langit kelas."

# game/week4.rpy:172
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_7995fdb4:

    # radit "Traitor. Leaving me alone with the hurricane? Fine, go eat. Just don't let Sabian talk your ear off about his latest project."
    radit  "Pengkhianat. Tega-teganya ninggalin aku sendirian sama badai tornado itu? Ya udah sana makan. Awas aja kalau sampai dipungut jadi kacung senior."

# game/week4.rpy:179
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_483a845e:

    # n "You jog to catch up with Sabian, leaving the studio behind. The canteen is buzzing—a welcome escape from the tension of the workspace."
    n  "Kamu berlari kecil menyusul Sabian, meninggalkan studio di belakang. Kantin sekolah tampak riuh ramai dipenuhi antrean siswa."

# game/week4.rpy:181
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_200a4a42:

    # n "As you enter, Sabian claps a hand on your shoulder."
    n  "Saat melangkah masuk, Sabian menepuk pundakmu dengan ramah."

# game/week4.rpy:182
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_b8ef3521:

    # sabian "Took you long enough! Thought you were going to spend your whole break running errands. Sit, sit."
    sabian  "Lama amat lu! Gue kira lu bakal ngabisin jam istirahat cuma buat jadi kurir tugas."

# game/week4.rpy:183
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_9236e00b:

    # n "You made your orders and hopped into the seat across from him."
    n  "Kamu memesan makanan dan duduk di bangku tepat di seberang mejanya."

# game/week4.rpy:184
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_943b655a:

    # n "The conversation shifts to topics worlds away from your daily grind. It's very chaotic, and for once, you don't have to think about tasks or anything to fix Trida's game stats."
    n  "Obrolan pun beralih ke topik-topik santai yang jauh dari penatnya rutinitas harian sekolah. Suasananya begitu hangat dan menghibur."

# game/week4.rpy:185
translate indonesian week4_canteen_sabian_9be47fd1:

    # n "It's the perfect small recharge, even as the guilty part of you wonders how Radit will survive."
    n  "Ini adalah momen istirahat kecil yang sempurna, meski di dalam hati kamu sempat bertanya-tanya bagaimana nasib Radit sendirian di kelas."

# game/week4.rpy:193
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_54f6bc32:

    # n "Radit looks at you, his smirk softening into something almost... relieved."
    n  "Radit menatapmu, seringai sinisnya perlahan melunak menjadi sesuatu yang tampak... begitu lega."

# game/week4.rpy:194
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_e1c7d389:

    # n "He starts walking toward the classroom, his posture finally relaxing."
    n  "Ia mulai melangkah santai menuju deretan meja kelas, postur tubuhnya akhirnya kembali rileks."

# game/week4.rpy:195
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_061ec006:

    # radit "Honestly? Let's go, I've got some leftover snacks in my bag if you're actually gonna die of hunger."
    radit  "Jujur ya? Mendingan kita di sini aja. Aku masih punya sisa camilan di tas kalau kamu emang beneran laper."

# game/week4.rpy:201
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_d39e124c:

    # n "You walk through with Radit as the chaotic noise of break time slowly fades behind you, replaced by the cool air of the empty classroom."
    n  "Kamu melangkah masuk kembali bersama Radit saat kebisingan jam istirahat perlahan memudar di luar ruangan."

# game/week4.rpy:202
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_52c29b7d:

    # n "Radit drops into his chair and tosses a bag of chips to you."
    n  "Radit menjatuhkan diri ke kursinya dan melemparkan sebungkus keripik kentang ke mejamu."

# game/week4.rpy:203
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_c082bce1:

    # n "He doesn't say anything for a while, just pulls out his phone to scroll through game forums."
    n  "Ia tidak mengucapkan sepatah kata pun untuk beberapa saat, hanya mengeluarkan ponselnya dan menggulir linimasa dengan santai."

# game/week4.rpy:204
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_17a13cca:

    # n "You put your head down on your desk, the cool wood feeling amazing against your face."
    n  "Kamu merebahkan kepala di atas meja, permukaan kayu yang sejuk terasa begitu nyaman menyentuh pipimu."

# game/week4.rpy:205
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_1161aef7:

    # n "You don't have to entertain anyone or fix anyone's problems. It's the kind of recharge that actually feels like a break."
    n  "Kamu tidak perlu menghibur siapa pun atau repot-repot memikirkan masalah orang lain. Ini adalah tipe istirahat yang paling kamu butuhkan."

# game/week4.rpy:207
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_be5e1bd8:

    # radit "You know, you're the only person who doesn't constantly try to force me to talk."
    radit  "Tahu nggak, kamu tuh satu-satunya orang yang nggak pernah maksa aku buat terus-terusan ngomong."

# game/week4.rpy:208
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_898f2f55:

    # n "His eyes were still glued to the phone, but you knew the sentence was for you."
    n  "Matanya masih terpaku pada layar ponsel, namun kamu tahu kalimat itu ditujukan khusus untukmu."

# game/week4.rpy:209
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_8fb9c078:

    # radit "It's appreciated."
    radit  "Aku bener-bener ngehargai itu."

# game/week4.rpy:210
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_c1412961:

    # n "You shift your head slightly on the desk, looking over at him. Then a soft laugh escapes your mouth as you start to unpack the chips bag."
    n  "Kamu menggeser posisi kepalamu sedikit di atas meja, menatap ke arahnya. Lalu tawa lembut meluncur pelan dari bibirmu."

# game/week4.rpy:214
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_570fdfd4:

    # p "Yeah, well, someone has to balance your edge. Honestly, you're way less annoying when you aren't talking."
    p  "Iya lah, harus ada yang ngimbangin sikap dinginmu itu kan. Lagian kamu jauh lebih mending pas lagi anteng gini."

# game/week4.rpy:216
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_bc50747a:

    # p "It's nice to just chill, you know? Plus, you're decent company when you aren't roasting people."
    p  "Enak juga bisa santai kayak gini kan? Lagipula kamu temen ngobrol yang asyik kok kalau lagi nggak mode nyinyir."

# game/week4.rpy:218
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_d4da2baf:

    # p "I'm literally too fried to talk. Just enjoying the silence, man. Don't take it the wrong way."
    p  "Otakku beneran lagi ngebul banget buat diajak ngomong. Cuma pengen nikmatin suasana hening aja, Bro. Jangan baper ya."

# game/week4.rpy:221
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_a1a4b53e:

    # n "Radit lets out a low, genuine laugh that you rarely catch; he looks more relaxed. He taps his screen down, then glances over at you."
    n  "Radit tertawa renyah dan tulus, suara tawa yang jarang sekali kamu dengar darinya; ia tampak jauh lebih santai sekarang."

# game/week4.rpy:222
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_d794edd5:

    # radit "Don't get used to it, man. I've got a whole list of sarcastic comments ready for when the others get back."
    radit  "Jangan kebiasaan ya. Aku masih punya sekotak amunisi sarkasme yang siap kutembak kapan aja."

# game/week4.rpy:223
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_d6f99c67:

    # n "He tosses his phone onto his desk and leans back, closing his eyes for a second. The classroom is silent again; even so, it was not an awkward quietness. There is something warmer about it."
    n  "Ia meletakkan ponselnya di meja dan bersandar ke kursi, memejamkan matanya selama beberapa detik."

# game/week4.rpy:224
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_023d783d:

    # radit "Glad you ditched him. That senior was giving me a headache just by existing."
    radit  "Bagus deh kamu nggak ikut senior tadi. Ngelihat mukanya aja udah bikin kepalaku cenat-cenut."

# game/week4.rpy:225
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_b25b8290:

    # n "A slow snort comes from your lips as you munch through the chips on your desk."
    n  "Dengusan geli meluncur dari hidungmu saat kamu mengunyah keripik di mejamu."

# game/week4.rpy:226
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_cf2996f5:

    # p "I think he just wanted someone to be his pack mule."
    p  "Kayaknya dia tadi cuma nyari orang buat dijadiin kuli angkut barang deh."

# game/week4.rpy:227
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_8e767515:

    # radit "Exactly. Which is why you have top-tier taste in friends. Keep it up."
    radit  "Persis. Makanya selera pertemananmu itu top-tier banget. Pertahankan ya."

# game/week4.rpy:228
translate indonesian week4_classroom_radit_7cfed664:

    # n "He went back to his phone, but the silence shifted, and a whole lot more was earned. For these few minutes, everything feels like it can be tossed aside."
    n  "Ia kembali fokus ke ponselnya, namun keheningan kali ini terasa jauh lebih hangat, penuh rasa saling memahami yang tulus."

# game/week4.rpy:244
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_6414da16:

    # n "The golden hour light stretched long across the pavement, painting the world in warm, hazy tones as you and Trida drifted away from the gates of SMK Raden Umar Said."
    n  "Sinar keemasan mentari senja terbentang panjang di atas aspal jalanan, mewarnai dunia dalam hangatnya rona madu."

# game/week4.rpy:245
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_396feebe:

    # n "A cooling breeze carried the savory, irresistible scent of round tofu frying nearby, grounding you in the simple peace of the late afternoon."
    n  "Semilir angin sore membawa aroma gurih tahu bulat goreng yang begitu menggoda dari gerobak pedagang di dekat gerbang."

# game/week4.rpy:247
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_dc090883:

    # n "Trida moved with restless energy, clutching a greasy plastic bag of snacks in one hand and a carton of chocolate milk in the other."
    n  "Trida melangkah dengan energi yang tak pernah habis, menenteng kantong plastik berminyak berisi camilan hangat di sebelah tangannya."

# game/week4.rpy:248
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_4f1a0750:

    # n "They seemed caught in their own internal rhythm, their excitement bubbling over with every step, and you found yourself falling into pace beside them, letting the routine of the walk settle over you like a familiar blanket."
    n  "Ia tampak tenggelam dalam ritme dunianya sendiri, rasa antusiasnya meluap-luap di setiap langkah kakinya."

# game/week4.rpy:250
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_a112b40b:

    # trida "Y'know, I feel like these past four weeks have been... intense, right? Like, in a good way, but also in a 'my brain is turning into a tangled wire' kind of way."
    trida  "Tahu nggak, aku ngerasa empat minggu belakangan ini tuh... intens banget kan ya? Maksudku—dalam artian yang seru banget!"

# game/week4.rpy:251
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_1b597e91:

    # p "Tell me about it."
    p  "Bener banget, nggak usah ditanya lagi."

# game/week4.rpy:252
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_19e21cc8:

    # trida "It's like we're trapped in some game, except instead of leveling up stats, we're just stuck obsessing over cubes, extrusions, and topology that makes me want to pull my hair out."
    trida  "Rasanya kayak kita lagi terjebak di dalam game, cuma bedanya bukannya naikin status karakter, kita malah berusaha bertahan hidup dari tugas harian."

# game/week4.rpy:254
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_561b0f9b:

    # n "Trida pauses, looking up at the sky where the orange light is beginning to fade into a deep indigo."
    n  "Trida terdiam sejenak, mendongak menatap langit di mana semburat jingga perlahan mulai pudar ditelan gelapnya malam."

# game/week4.rpy:255
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_46a4ad16:

    # n "They shift the plastic bag, their fingers tapping rhythmically against the side of their chocolate milk carton—a clear sign they're bracing themself before looking over at you."
    n  "Ia memindahkan kantong plastik camilannya, jemarinya mengetuk-ngetuk sisi wadah dengan ketukan berirama."

# game/week4.rpy:257
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_d74839be:

    # n "Trida's steps faltered, their frantic rhythm finally tapering off. They shifted their stance to meet your gaze, the warm glow of the sky overhead bleeding into dusk to drape their features in soft, flickering amber."
    n  "Langkah kaki Trida melambat, ritme terburu-burunya akhirnya mereda. Ia menatap ke depan menatap jalanan yang mulai sepi."

# game/week4.rpy:258
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_98a6332c:

    # n "The morning's chaotic energy had vanished, replaced by a rare, quiet fragility that seemed to settle over them like the evening chill."
    n  "Energi heboh dari pagi hari tadi kini telah lenyap, digantikan oleh sisi kerapuhan yang tenang dan jarang sekali ia perlihatkan."

# game/week4.rpy:260
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_891c015d:

    # trida "Even so, I think I'm starting to trying to love it."
    trida  "Meskipun capek, kayaknya aku mulai berusaha buat bener-bener mencintai proses ini deh."

# game/week4.rpy:261
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_70ee8183:

    # trida "I mean... if I didn't have the passion, I don't think I'd ever feel like I could actually see a future for myself here."
    trida  "Maksudku... kalau dari awal aku nggak punya passion di sini, kayaknya aku nggak bakal sanggup ngelewatin semua ini sampai sekarang."

# game/week4.rpy:262
translate indonesian week4_sunset_walk_5ef607f5:

    # trida "...How about you? Can you picture it yet?"
    trida  "...Kalau kamu sendiri gimana? Udah mulai kebayang belum masa depanmu di sini?"

# game/week4.rpy:274
translate indonesian week4_trida_gamble_ca3705d1:

    # p "It's a gamble, I guess. But we're only four weeks in—maybe it's too early to decide if we're winning or losing."
    p  "Namanya juga pertaruhan kan. Tapi kita kan baru jalan empat minggu—kayaknya masih kepagian buat nentuin kita bakal menang atau kalah."

# game/week4.rpy:275
translate indonesian week4_trida_gamble_3006f98e:

    # trida "Yeah... that's a good point. I'm pretty sure I'd have gone crazy by now if not for you being a good pal."
    trida  "Iya juga sih... bener katamu. Aku yakin aku udah gila dari kemarin kalau bukan karena ada kamu yang nemenin."

# game/week4.rpy:281
translate indonesian week4_trida_worth_0cd820a3:

    # p "I think it's worth it. Especially with you around makes it fun."
    p  "Menurutku semuanya sepadan kok. Apalagi kalau ngelewatinnya bareng kamu, rasanya jadi seru banget."

# game/week4.rpy:282
translate indonesian week4_trida_worth_3006f98e:

    # trida "Yeah... that's a good point. I'm pretty sure I'd have gone crazy by now if not for you being a good pal."
    trida  "Iya juga sih... bener katamu. Aku yakin aku udah gila dari kemarin kalau bukan karena ada kamu yang nemenin."

# game/week4.rpy:288
translate indonesian week4_trida_crash_a5b57b3b:

    # p "Don't 'crash out' yet. We haven't even finished our first animation project, and you're already worried about the end?"
    p  "Jangan buru-buru nyerah dong. Proyek animasi pertama kita aja belum beres, masa kamu udah cemas mikirin akhir kelulusan sih?"

# game/week4.rpy:289
translate indonesian week4_trida_crash_3006f98e:

    # trida "Yeah... that's a good point. I'm pretty sure I'd have gone crazy by now if not for you being a good pal."
    trida  "Iya juga sih... bener katamu. Aku yakin aku udah gila dari kemarin kalau bukan karena ada kamu yang nemenin."

# game/week4.rpy:294
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_1ea0c5ec:

    # trida "I'm always spiraling about whether I've got the skills for this, but then it hits me... even if I hit a 'game over,' I'm hitting it with you."
    trida  "Aku tuh sering banget overthinking apakah skill-ku beneran cukup buat jurusan ini, tapi pas lagi bareng kamu, rasanya semua beban itu menguap."

# game/week4.rpy:295
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_11457ac0:

    # n "Trida pauses softly."
    n  "Trida berhenti melangkah sejenak dengan suara pelan."

# game/week4.rpy:296
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_1079143b:

    # trida "That makes the whole thing feel way less like a nightmare."
    trida  "Bikin semua hal berat ini nggak berasa kayak mimpi buruk lagi."

# game/week4.rpy:299
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_de9bcf8d:

    # n "They offer a lopsided, genuine smile, nudging your arm with their elbow—a faint attempt to lighten the sudden weight of the moment."
    n  "Ia menyunggingkan senyum tulus yang sedikit canggung, menyenggol pelan lenganmu dengan sikunya—sebuah gestur hangat penuh kasih sayang."

# game/week4.rpy:300
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_707e5de4:

    # trida "Don't worry, I'm not sweating it. Not yet. We did a lot of work this year. You're stuck with me until you graduate, am I right?"
    trida  "Tenang aja, aku nggak bakal nyerah secepet itu kok. Belum saatnya. Kita udah ngelewatin banyak hal bareng tahun ini. Kamu bakal terus nemenin aku kan?"

# game/week4.rpy:301
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_2074ff12:

    # p "Heh, I'd like to see that."
    p  "Heh, boleh juga tuh. Aku tunggu pembuktiannya ya."

# game/week4.rpy:303
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_f69a17cd:

    # n "Walking in the direction of the sunset, your gaze catches how the warm beams of light hit Trida's grin as if it's a sunny aura radiating from their face."
    n  "Melangkah beriringan menuju arah terbenamnya matahari, tatapanmu menangkap hangatnya cahaya senja yang memeluk sosok di sampingmu."

# game/week4.rpy:304
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_9667dee5:

    # n "Your mind starts to wander and contemplate what Trida promised."
    n  "Pikiranmu melayang merenungkan janji manis yang baru saja diucapkan Trida."

# game/week4.rpy:305
translate indonesian week4_walk_conclusion_7920f516:

    # p "Stuck with me, huh?"
    p  "Bakal terus barengan sama aku ya?"

